  "cover_text": "system requires only 12 seconds to open or close. T —It determines if the electronic component is close to the ground from where it opens/ closes the circuit.A —The resistor has a characteristic in which it gets the very low resistance when no current is passing through it, or its resistance. the component has a characteristic such that, when current passes through it, its resistance is so high that it doesn't conduct the current.B —A circuit containing two resistors leads to an inductance. Between two square measures, leakage current is many times multiples of the trickle. C — indicates a voltage imbalance",
